<title>CANADA: Imax, Ogden in 15 theater venture.</title>
<headline>Imax, Ogden in 15 theater venture.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Imax Corp and a division of Ogden Corp said on Wednesday they signed a letter of intent to develop, build and operate 15 Imax theaters over the next three to five years.</p>
<p>No financial terms were disclosed.  </p>
<p>The companies said the theaters would be mainly in North America, with additional locations in South America and Asia.</p>
<p>The first two theaters were expected to open in the autumn of 1997 in Grapevine, Texas and Tempe, Arizona, Imax said.</p>
<p>&quot;We expect to reap tremendous benefits from Ogden's expertise in in international development, construction, management and operations,&quot; Imax said.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
